<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT color=#000000>一、选派人数和工作时间<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT face="Times New Roman"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"><FONT color=#000000>我市选派</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #191f25; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">新一轮“组团式”</SPAN><FONT color=#000000><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">援藏教师</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">名，高中数学学科，</SPAN></FONT><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #191f25; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">秋季开学进藏对口支援拉萨那曲高级中学，援藏期限<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>年。</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 31.35pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold"><FONT color=#000000>二、选派条件<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P><PRE style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: none"><FONT face=宋体><FONT color=#000000><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体">（一）</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">素质要求：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体">思想政治素质好，认真学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想，政治意识、大局意识、核心意识、看齐意识强，坚决执行党的民族政策和宗教政策，坚决维护国家安全、祖国统一和民族团结；全面贯彻党的教育方针，坚持社会主义办学方向，遵循教育规律和学生成长规律，师德高尚，作风扎实，具有较强的工作能力和责任感，不怕吃苦，甘于奉献，善于团结；身体健康，心理素质好，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">能够适应艰苦地区工作。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"> <SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></FONT></PRE><PRE style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: none"><FONT color=#000000><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体">（二）</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">年龄要求：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体">援藏教师年龄一般在</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>45</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体">周岁以下，能适应高原工作环境。个别符合岗位需求、个人意愿强烈的教师，在身体条件许可情况下，年龄可适当放宽。</SPAN></FONT><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"> <SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></PRE>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT face="Times New Roman"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">（三）</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">任职要求：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">原则上选派具有大学本科及以上学历，已经聘任在一级教师岗位满</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年及以上，并符合晋升高一级教师职称条件的教师。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT color=#000000><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">三、政策待遇</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><FONT face="Times New Roman"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">援藏教师的待遇按照省委组织部选派的援藏援疆援青专业技术人才规定执行。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><FONT color=#000000><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">四、报名办法</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT color=#000000><FONT face="Times New Roman"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">本次教师选派援藏期限为</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年，各</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">区、县（市）教育局和市直普高要积极动员，做好援藏教师选派的报名工作<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>具体</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">各</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">区、县（市）最多报名<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>人，各市直普高最多报名<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>人。报名后将集中组织体检。各地各校请在<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>日上午下班前将名单和报名表（见附件）报市教育局政治处，联系人：何斌，联系电话：<SPAN lang=EN-US>85221460</SPAN>。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"><FONT color=#000000><FONT face="Times New Roman">附件：绍兴市选派第九批援藏干部人才报名表<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><FONT color=#000000><FONT face="Times New Roman"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN><o:p></o:p></FONT></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT color=#000000 face="Times New Roman"> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><FONT face="Times New Roman"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                          </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">绍兴市教育局办公室<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><FONT face="Times New Roman"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                              </SPAN>2019</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">年<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>日<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face="Times New Roman"> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P> </P></FONT></SPAN>
    
